      "parameters": {
        "width": 520,
        "height": 460,
        "color": 4,
        "content": "## 27 · AI Feedback Analyzer\nAnalyses product feedback for sentiment, themes and feature requests and routes critical bugs to the product team.\n\n**Trigger:** `POST /webhook/feedback-analyzer` (JSON body)\n\n**Setup**\n1. Edit the **Config** node (model, sheet URL, endpoints).\n2. Connect credentials: Google Sheets OAuth2, OpenAI API, Slack.\n3. Pick Slack channels / sheet tabs on the action nodes.\n4. Activate.\n\n**Sample payload:**\n```json\n{\n \"user\": \"meera@bigcorp.com\",\n \"feedback\": \"Love the new dashboard, but exporting to CSV deletes half of my rows. Please add dark mode.\"\n}\n```"
      }
